## 1. Product Overview

SmartResume AI lets students, freshers and professionals build ATS-friendly resumes in a live editor, improve wording with an AI assistant, score the resume against a job description with a transparent heuristic ATS analyzer, and export a print-ready A4 PDF with selectable text.

Primary focus: **college students and freshers applying for internships and entry-level software engineering roles.**

## 2. Problem Statement

1. Students lack design skills and produce cluttered resumes (tables, images, multi-column layouts) that parse badly in Applicant Tracking Systems.
2. Fresher resumes are weak in content: vague bullets ("worked on a website"), no metrics, no action verbs.
3. Students do not know which keywords a job description expects, so they apply with untailored resumes.
4. Existing tools are paywalled, over-complicated, or hide how scores are calculated.

## 3. Proposed Solution

A single web app combining: (a) structured resume editor with live preview, (b) four professionally designed templates, (c) AI writing assistant with strict "never invent facts" guardrails, (d) deterministic, explainable ATS analyzer and job-description matcher, (e) server-rendered PDF export that matches the preview, (f) dashboard for managing multiple resumes.

## 4. Product Vision

*"Every student can produce a clean, honest, ATS-friendly resume in under 15 minutes — and understand exactly why it will or won't match a job."*

Design principles: **Honest** (AI never fabricates; scores are labelled estimates), **Transparent** (every score has visible reasons), **Fast** (autosave, instant preview), **Simple** (no clutter).

## 5. Target Audience

College students, fresh graduates, internship applicants, job seekers, experienced professionals (secondary).

