## 15. User Journeys

1. **First resume:** Landing → Register → Dashboard (sample resume exists) → "New resume" → choose template → fill Personal info → add Education/Skills/Projects → ✨ improve bullets (accept 2) → completion 85% → Analyze ATS → fix 3 recommendations → Download PDF.
2. **Tailor for a job:** Dashboard → open resume → Job Matcher → paste JD → review missing skills → "Create tailored copy" → apply suggestions → re-run ATS (score ↑) → PDF.
3. **Returning user:** Open app → silent session restore → Dashboard → duplicate resume → rename → edit → download.
4. **AI outage:** User clicks ✨ → banner "AI unavailable — showing rule-based suggestions" → verb suggestions still work.

